cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file. Please also cite the Sleep-EDF Database Expanded as listed under references."
type: software
title: "Brain Model (BM-2026): ST44 raw-signal surrogate analysis code and provenance records"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, prespecified analysis plans and provenance records for a
  retrospective, falsification-oriented test of second-order temporal
  structure in N2 sleep EEG from the Sleep-EDF Expanded sleep-telemetry
  recordings (Brain Model project, BM-2026). The repository contains the
  BM-A031 Rev2 G2 lower-order diagnostic runner, its regression tests, the
  BM-A027 analysis plan with Amendments 001 and 002, and the project's
  migration ledger.
